	(text "HSE: 24 MHz crystal. Load caps C = 2 x (CL - Cstray) = 2 x (12 - 3) pF = 18 pF.\nRecompute if the crystal you buy has a different CL. Keep Y201 + caps tight to PH0/PH1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.69 56.134 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6331dd22-7cc8-4bc5-a183-d8f7d9d20376")
	)
	(text "Pin plan: LaneBus on PA8/PA9 (I3C1/I2C1 SDA/SCL), PB14 BUS_INT, PA10 CHAIN_OUT, PB15 SYNC (TIM12_CH2).\nUSB PA11/PA12, USB_FAULT PB12, LANE_PWR_EN PA6. USART1 PB6/PB7 -> BLE, BLE_IRQ PB5, BLE_GPIO1/2 = PB4/PA15 (NJTRST/JTDI: pulled up after reset).\nJ302: EXT_PWR_EN PA5, EXT_PWR_FAULT PA4, USART2 PA2/PA3, UART4 PA0/PA1 (PA1 NOT 5 V tolerant!). J303: SPI SCK PB10, MOSI PB2, MISO PA7, CS1 PB1, CS2 PB0.\nUI: LED_STATUS PB13 (TIM8_CH2), LED_ACT PB8 (TIM1_CH1) -> independent PWM, BTN1/2/3 = PC15/PC13/PE2. Spare: PB9, PC14 (TIM12_CH1, weak source)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "65a8c03e-56d4-4939-8d21-764ce6108762")
	)
